  "ok": true,
  "result_event": 512,
  "issue": "ENG-2439",
  "body": "Line is 407,944 (DD 337,594 / ZM 59,250 / CF 11,100), not the 374,654 the notices add up to. Leapblock's accountant closed our file and posted in #leapblock (Feb 13) what they received: 2023 104,868 (from 13 Sep, first wire 33,290), 2024 232,726, 2025 62,950, 2026 7,400, 30 wires. Per the angel note, the closeout beats the notices. The difference is the Sep 13 2023 wire (33,290), which has no Payment Processed notice. 2024/2025/2026 match the notices exactly. 2025 splits 59,250 ZM + 3,700 CF (Dec 11 wire)."
 },
 {
  "event": 513,
  "id": "toolu_vrtx_01Jm1GMTmRvdMd9kQZJs9TZB",
  "tool": "linear_create_comment",
  "context": "main",
  "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
  "ok": true,
  "result_event": 514,
  "issue": "ENG-2442",
  "body": "Line is 37,056 (DD 28,128 / ZM 8,928), not the 41,088 the notices add up to. Leonard said in Slack (Feb 13) that the Apr 2 2024 wire to account ending 8605 (4,032) came back: Blake had the wrong number and re-sent it to 3341 (Apr 5 notice). Counted once."
 },
 {
  "event": 515,
  "id": "toolu_vrtx_0111yXvmNDrPaLaqtcekaiBW",
  "tool": "linear_create_comment",
  "context": "main",
  "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
  "ok": true,
  "result_event": 516,
  "issue": "ENG-2447",
  "body": "Line is 13,975 (all DD), not the 6,450 the three SVB notices add up to (Sep/Oct/Nov 2024). Before those, I paid Lucas via Western Union and the receipts are in my mail: Jun 3, Jun 17, Jun 29 2024 (1,075 each), Jul 23 and Aug 23 2024 (2,150 each) = 7,525 sent. Counted at the amount sent, not the fee (0.99 per transfer excluded), as the angel note says."
 },
 {
  "event": 517,
  "id": "toolu_vrtx_01Wq1UtH2UMXWczUxo5yKEqy",
  "tool": "linear_create_comment",
  "context": "main",
  "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
  "ok": true,
  "result_event": 518,
  "issue": "ENG-2459",
  "body": "Line is 0, not the 125 on the notice. Per Leonard's note above, the May 7 2024 wire came back the same day. It was re-sent through Payoneer, but no Payoneer receipt reached my mail (only Payoneer payment requests from Dixelar on May 5 and Sep 25 2024, which are requests, not receipts), so per the angel note it doesn't go in. Bucket: Marketing (ad videos). The line stays at zero."
 },
 {
  "event": 519,
  "id": "toolu_vrtx_01TzvnoWC8sgipGQxACXJXug",
  "tool": "linear_create_comment",
  "context": "main",
  "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
  "ok": true,
  "result_event": 520,
  "issue": "ENG-2450",
  "body": "Line is 0, not the 4,000 on the Aug 19 2024 notice. Blake confirmed by email (Feb 13, \"Chase records\") that account ending 3203 is our own Chase account. He sent the money over to put it back after Carta's renewal came out of Chase, so it never left the company. Money moved between our own accounts isn't spending: no bucket, and the line stays at zero."
 },
